Package: icesdataqa
Title: Data Quality Checks for ICES Stock Assessment Graphs Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Serge-Alain", "Nyamsin", email = "sergealain_nyamsin@yahoo.fr",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A small framework of structural, statistical and timeliness
    checks for the data served by the ICES Stock Assessment Graphs (SAG) web
    services. Every check returns a standardised result row, and checks are
    run stock by stock so that stocks which do not report a variable are not
    mistaken for gaps. The repository also holds a 'targets' pipeline and a
    'Quarto' report built on these functions. Independent project, not an
    official ICES product.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
